# NA-65 docs-sync fixture snapshots — pinned byte-for-byte to docs_sync_fixture_gen.py's raw
# output; reformatting them would desync the committed golden files from what the generator
# actually writes and break docs-sync-fixtures.test.sh's diff assertion.
plugins/sdlc/scripts/__tests__/fixtures/*/expected/

# NA-86 / ADR 0016 — Prettier's remark-based Markdown parser has repeatedly corrupted plugin
# markdown that a pre-commit `--check` reported clean (the NA-56 corruption class); ignoring
# plugins/sdlc/**/*.md removes that corruption risk outright and lets a one-time manual table
# unpad (padded-row cost: 40,225 static / 54,161 per-story tokens) stay stable going forward.
plugins/sdlc/**/*.md
